{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread","id":1000616,"title":"2016 Election Result Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-08T22:20:26-08:00","id":1000616,"title":"2016 Election Result Thread","content":"Well, the results aren't in yet, but it's looking more and more like Donald Trump is going to be the next president. He's got a big lead in the electoral college and he's leading in most of the rest of the states that are still in play. I think there are a lot of lessons for the Democrats to take away from this campaign, starting with, don't run a candidate who's under such a cloud of scandals as Hillary was. I think the latest blowup over her emails that occurred last week was the final straw that caused a lot of Republicans, who had previously been considering not voting for Trump or Hillary to instead hold their nose and vote for Trump in order to keep Hillary out of the White House.<br /> <br /> Well, the race is so close in so many states that regardless of who wins I expect it will be contested for a few days. But, it was certainly an interesting race and we are headed for some interesting times indeed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-08T23:27:44-08:00","id":1000627,"title":"","content":"Yeeeah...looks like it's pretty much all over. They're saying Hillary could still win the Popular vote, but what good would that do? And it's not just the Democrats who have some lessons to learn, it's also the Republican leaders have to do a LOT of rethinking about things, as they've pretty much lost control of their own Party. This is...pretty much the biggest upset in recent political history. Both Parties may well look *very* different from this point on...<br /> <br /> Who else *could* the Dems have fronted, tho? Who would have had even this good of a chance? Is it really possible that she mainly lost just for being female, that a male candidate would have had a better chance? <br /> <br /> Oh, and Repubs have control of BOTH Houses, as well...Now it's time for them to finally put their money where their mouths have been and PROVE that they will truly reach across and work with the other side. Good luck with that. Interesting times ahead, indeed...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-08T23:41:28-08:00","id":1000630,"title":"","content":"Funnily enough, I was just telling someone earlier, that even if Trump should somehow win, the sun will still rise, we'll still get up and go to work, drink with friends, be with our families...America will still go on. Some things will likely be worse, but the general quality of life is not likely to change much, hopefully. Keep calm and carry on, as they say.<br /> <br /> What are the chances of Obamacare <i>actually</i> being repealed now, tho?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-08T23:56:59-08:00","id":1000636,"title":"","content":"And yeah, it looks like it's all over. President Donald J. Trump. Plus the Republicans have control over the House, and a majority in the Senate (there's still 2 seats up for grabs but Republicans already have 51 seats), so they'll be able to get a pretty hardcore conservative on the Supreme Court, which will grant them power over all three sections of the federal government for at least two years.<br /> <br /> It's going to be very interesting to see where Trump and the Republican party steer the United States over the ensuring next several years.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 11-09-2016, 03:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T00:12:54-08:00","id":1000639,"title":"","content":"I would like to pray for those who will be hurt by this.<br /> <br /> But my religion doesn't practice the ritual of prayer.<br /> <br /> I would like to make a nice poem about this.<br /> <br /> But my artistic skills don't feel very inspired right now.<br /> <br /> I would like to hope for the well-being of those who will be hurt by this.<br /> <br /> But I can barely muster an ember of hope for myself.<br /> <br /> So, stay safe I guess. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T00:21:40-08:00","id":1000641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1000627#post1000627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Who else *could* the Dems have fronted, tho? Who would have had even this good of a chance? Is it really possible that she mainly lost just for being female, that a male candidate would have had a better chance?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hillary was under a number of black scandals (yes, many of them manufactured) but what's important isn't whether those scandals were true or false but that people believed them intensely. Hillary was one of the most disliked, distrusted and divisive political figures in America. I don't think it's &quot;because she's a woman,&quot; but rather because she's done a lot of shady stuff and the Republicans have spent a lot of time and a lot money throwing as much mud on her as they possibly could over the course of many, many years.<br /> <br /> I think Bernie Sanders or nearly any other Democrat would have been much more popular with middle America than Hillary was, and wouldn't have been so odious to conservatives that they would have been willing to vote for Trump in order to stop the Democrat. I mean, for example, there was a lot of talk that Hillary could have gotten Utah since the polls showed so many conservatives were unwilling to vote for Trump... right up until the email scandal broke again and many of those Republicans decided that Trump was the lesser of the two evils.<br /> <br /> More interesting, I think, is that this showed the current method of political polling isn't accurate. The vast majority of polls showed Hillary with a sizable lead in many swing states that she ended up losing. Those polling companies will have to rethink how they conduct their polls because they ended up being a joke.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 11-09-2016, 03:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T00:23:21-08:00","id":1000642,"title":"","content":"It looks like Clinton has conceded.<br /> <br /> I.. I don't even know what's going to happen to me now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4578-zale","name":"Zale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4578_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:",