crifice everything they cherished because they believed America was worth that sacrifice. We have betrayed our most basic ideals. We have betrayed ourselves. We have broken the faith.<br /> <br /> For the first time in my life, I am profoundly ashamed to be an American.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T01:25:28-08:00","id":1000662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1000655#post1000655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beware the curse of living in interesting times.<br /> \u200b<br /> Don't kid yourself. Bernie was as goofy as Trump. All he could possibly have accomplished was to drive down Democratic turnout. No. More than half of America knew exactly how vile Trump is -- and voted for him anyway. More than half of America knew how ignorant and incompetent Trump is -- and voted for him anyway.<br /> <br /> \u200bThe American voter is in a &quot;fuck-the-world&quot; mood and no Democrat could have bucked <i>that</i> trend.<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200bI'd like to say something supportive or comforting, but I can't.<br /> <br /> \u200bAmerica is not special anymore. It is just a place on a map. It's just an empty slogan.<br /> We have proven under Klieg lights for all the world to see that we are a nation of racist, misogynistic, xenophobes. We are no better than all the other racist, misogynistic, xenophobe countries we used chide.<br /> \u200bWe have betrayed the memory of those who were willing to sacrifice everything they cherished because they believed America was worth that sacrifice. We have betrayed our most basic ideals. We have betrayed ourselves. We have broken the faith.<br /> <br /> For the first time in my life, I am profoundly ashamed to be an American.</div> </div> </div> </div>Believe me, there is worst things out there than not being a complete social justice warrior.<br /> <br /> source:i'm brazilian.<br /> <br /> Honestly, Trump sounded like the second coming of Franklin Roosevelt to you guys. Guess only time will tell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12264-isengrim","name":"Isengrim","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T02:49:02-08:00","id":1000678,"title":"","content":"Well, okay.<br /> <br /> I don't think everything will explode. This is not the end of the world. But I do think many things will get significantly harder for a significant amount of people in the USA who have historically had it really hard already.<br /> <br /> I think the most important message here is that the nationalistic, reactionary movement, not only in the USA but in Europe as well, is not a fringe one. It is strong enough to take prime spots in European governments, and now elect a president in the USA. This tendency (speaking as someone who won't have to be directly impacted by by being, y'know, actually ruled by Trump) is probably what scares me the most about this.<br /> <br /> I have some thinking to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T03:07:35-08:00","id":1000687,"title":"","content":"This <a href=\"http://www.cracked.com/blog/how-to-survive-after-election-no-matter-who-wins/\" target=\"_blank\">cracked article</a> from October tries to make you understand. From the outside this was lost because he was able to divide the working class, while not loosing enough in his base.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8249-crytash","name":"Crytash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8249_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date: