elections as well, but I don't remember which.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first time he lost the popular vote and his winning Florida was extremely dubious - a lot of votes didn't get counted because of stupid errors on the ballots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T08:26:00-08:00","id":1000804,"title":"","content":"My Canadian thoughts: The Republicans had a lot of power from 2000-2008 with Dubya and his cronies, but progress was still made on many social fronts across the nation of America. The Supreme Court Judge that needs to be replaced was an arch-conservative, and yet the Supreme Court still upheld gay marriage equality when he was alive, and many states went ahead on their own and advance LGBTQ rights. The majority of people didn't vote for Trump, just the [bare] majority who voted - he doesn't represent the vast majority of Americans, and the politicians still want their jobs when the next election comes around. &quot;President Trump: Year One - coming January 20th to Fox TV&quot; is not a good thing, but I spent a couple of hours trying to console my 15-year old daughter last night that this isn't the apocalypse, that there are checks and balances to stop the assholes from ruining everything, and that maybe, just maybe, things have to get bad before they get better. Perhaps if he's as terrible as he threatens to be, the folks who sat on their hands and thought &quot;I just won't vote for anyone, I hate them both&quot; will realize that all they did was help this to happen. It's possible his own party will impeach him if he's as corrupt as we know he is. He may be talking about &quot;change&quot;, but he's going to have to be surrounded by career politicians, so there isn't as much of a &quot;change in Washington&quot; as he wants everyone to think. Maybe this will galvanize the youth who will have to deal with the repercussions of this to take their future in their hands in four years when they are old enough to vote for a change. Shitty politicians come around, and they will again, but I doubt that even this assclown will be able to completely derail progress on social change, no matter how much he threatens to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5627-purple-snit","name":"Purple Snit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"309"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T08:43:30-08:00","id":1000815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/ZBxYhwiW7uE\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/ZBxYhwiW7uE\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/ZBxYhwiW7uE\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/ZBxYhwiW7uE </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> TYT on Bernie Sanders being blamed for Trump win.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T08:56:38-08:00","id":1000819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Purple Snit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1000804#post1000804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My Canadian thoughts: The Republicans had a lot of power from 2000-2008 with Dubya and his cronies, but progress was still made on many social fronts across the nation of America. The Supreme Court Judge that needs to be replaced was an arch-conservative, and yet the Supreme Court still upheld gay marriage equality when he was alive, and many states went ahead on their own and advance LGBTQ rights. The majority of people didn't vote for Trump, just the [bare] majority who voted - he doesn't represent the vast majority of Americans, and the politicians still want their jobs when the next election comes around. &amp;quot;President Trump: Year One - coming January 20th to Fox TV&amp;quot; is not a good thing, but I spent a couple of hours trying to console my 15-year old daughter last night that this isn't the apocalypse, that there are checks and balances to stop the assholes from ruining everything, and that maybe, just maybe, things have to get bad before they get better. Perhaps if he's as terrible as he threatens to be, the folks who sat on their hands and thought &amp;quot;I just won't vote for anyone, I hate them both&amp;quot; will realize that all they did was help this to happen. It's possible his own party will impeach him if he's as corrupt as we know he is. He may be talking about &amp;quot;change&amp;quot;, but he's going to have to be surrounded by career politicians, so there isn't as much of a &amp;quot;change in Washington&amp;quot; as he wants everyone to think. Maybe this will galvanize the youth who will have to deal with the repercussions of this to take their future in their hands in four years when they are old enough to vote for a change. Shitty politicians come around, and they will again, but I doubt that even this assclown will be able to completely derail progress on social change, no matter how much he threatens to.</div> </div> </div> </div> Hillary won the popular vote, but she lost the electoral college, so he didn't get a bare majority of American voters at all, he lost, but in Americas broken system if you get enough votes in the right places he wins anyways.<br /> <br /> I think alot of American and even Canadians are paniacing, this guy is a clown, but people imaginations are getting the best of them. Gay marriage is still not going away, abortion will still be legal, the wall, well you might get parts of a wall, a symbollic geasture at most, some people who are in America illegally will be deported, most most won't be his promise was goofy and impossible (heck Obama could just make them all citizens with an excutive order).<br /> <br /> My hope is Trump blocks the TPP, its the only promise I hope he keeps, aside from draining the Washinton Swamp, but I doubt he'll get rid of the corruption.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T09:05:47-08:00","id":1000825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1000802#post1000802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The first time he lost the popular vote and his winning Florida was extremely dubious - a lot of votes didn't get counted because of stupid errors on the ballots.</div> </div> </div> </div>(Just jumping in -- haven't read anybody else's posts... your's just caught my eye because it was at the top of the page I clicked to...)<br /> <br /> And the messed up thing about that? -- the confirmed recount the following year actually proved that Gore did, in fact, win Florida in 2000, but because the detail investigation didn't complete until the following year (2001), Bush was already put in office via the Supreme Court and his brother, so it was too late to &quot;mulligan&quot;.<br /> <br /> A sad, broken system we have when it comes to fine-lines...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T09:12:42-08:00","id":1000831,"title":"","content":"To those of us who are too poor to do much, and are worried that changes against our interests in medical care is going to literally kill us, sorry but your comments here are cold comfort. My mother died of cancer, her parents died of cancer. As I get older and older every bout of pneumonia, of bronchitis,etc gets harder and harder to fight off. Today I woke up to a country where I'm now worried that due to the way I talk I don't know whether or not some insane asshole is going to attack me for being a &quot;dirty foreigner.&quot; and where my prospects of saving for anything meaningful is likely dim. I'm done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2997,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":".  typo fixes, just woke up. 11-09-2016, 12:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T09:33:43-08:00","id":1000843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1000737#post1000737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Holy shit guys, can someone tell me what's happening in Seattle? I have an uncle who lives there and I heard there were polling stations attacked in Washington State- we haven't heard from him yet today. I'm Canadian, and my mother, who is an unflappable, almost fearless, woman was begging me to stay quiet and keep my head down in public today. There are Americans I know on social media who have said in the past months they'd kill themselves if Trump won, and I haven't heard from them at all since yesterday.<br /> <br /> Please, stay safe out there guys.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm on the Eastside here (Belluve/Redmond), haven't heard anything about attacks. I also cannot find any news stories about attacks, just some protesting. Where does your uncle live?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T09:46:46-08:00","id":1000847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1000831#post1000831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To those of us who are too poor to do much, and are worried that changes against our interests in medical care is going to literally kill us, sorry but your comments here are cold comfort. My mother died of cancer, her parents died of cancer. As I get older and older every bout of pneumonia, of bronchitis,etc gets harder and harder to fight off. Today I woke up to a country where I'm now worried that due to the way I talk I don't know whether or not some insane asshole is going to attack me for being a &amp;quot;dirty foreigner.&amp;quot; and where my prospects of saving for anything meaningful is likely dim. I'm done.</div> </div> </div> </div> Honestly I don't know what Trump is going to do on healthcare. There was a time believe it or not when Trump supported universal public health. I just pray Trump finds his soul whereever he placed it.<br /> <br /> I do wish the Demoacts had won the senate and congress, just to balance out Trump.<br /> <br /> I apologize if my comments came off as insensitive or cold. It all seems surreal to me. And I'm sorry about you losing a beloved family member.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T09:52:14-08:00","id":1000851,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://www.cbsnews.com/news/cbs-news-exit-polls-how-donald-trump-won-the-us-presidency/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.cbsnews.com/news/cbs-news...us-presidency/</a><br /> <br /> More details. More Black men voted for Trump then was expected, he beat Hillary amoung Republican and Independant female voters.<br /> <br /> 25% of Trump voters felt he was unqualified.<br /> <br /> The democracts should have run an outsider this election, but they only listened to their own voices and picked the establishment candiate. And now some are blaming it on her gender, so they've learned nothing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 11-09-2016, 12:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],