ion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":1923,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","user":"BigDamnHero","date":". 11-09-2016, 05:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T14:46:04-08:00","id":1000993,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zeroninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1000987#post1000987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The presidency is, and has been for some time, a complete farce. Look at how Trump was predicted by the Simpsons. Look at how both candidates were so dirty it was a race to see who could be the lesser evil. Both played on tokenism, Trump with Xenophobia and other forms of bigotry, and Hillary using gender politics and the wage gap. Both had so many scandals neither should've been allowed near the race, let alone to win the primaries. Hillary is in fact the deciding vote on casting Trump in this case though, as <b>she sabotaged Bernie in the primary, who was a clear win should he be the candidate, then elevated Trump due to polls showing him as the weakest link among RNC candidates</b>. Both are very corrupt, only Trump is also seemingly inept, much like George Bush Jr was. Both had media coverage that pandered to their viewers and hid flaws from the public. Both parties attempted things with the voting and so forth. Trump has never disclosed his earnings and <b>Hillary has had people assassinated,</b> among many, many other things. As far as I'm concerned this election was just an escalation of the shitshow it has been for some time. <b>One need only look at what happened to JFK when he attempted to speak out against the elite</b>, or at treasonous trash legislation like the Patriot Act and how it was not only allowed but encouraged, to see where this country has been going. <b>The President is merely a high paid actor in most situations,</b> although they do have leeway over several aspects of government. The clear and present dangers of things like the NSA were never addressed, not even by Bernie, what does that tell you?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Largely what happens when the kind of climate where the bolded assertions are not accepted for being the green ink blabbering they are has spawned it's candidate.<br /> <br /> Sadly, the world is more complex than a bunch of chessmasters with varying competence.<br /> <br /> (Also, this is not a slight against Sanders).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-09T14:48:30-08:00","id":1000995,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbc