meter on calling them hysterical.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And the protests are just embarrassing. He hasn't done anything yet, what are you protesting, democracy? I could see protesting the electoral college, but you do that before the election, not after. </div> </div> </div>The protests aren't embarrassing. They're peaceful applications of the First Amendment. As well, they serve an incredibly important purpose: to remind Trump that very shortly it will be his job to do right by those protesters as the President of the whole country, not just his electorate. He needs to see how big of a climb he has in that regard. He needs to remember that it's his job to lead us back from this, not those that didn't vote for him's job to do what he says because he won. It's a reminder that the anger that got him elected has a counter-anger riled up and they aren't ready to forgive him if he fails to live up to his victory speech promises.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T12:50:49-08:00","id":1001437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManusDomine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001431#post1001431\" rel=\"