t's not hand waving, it's disagreement over the issue being significant.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I wish you would stop being hypocritical. One one hand you're apparently all for, &amp;quot;1. We'll never move forward if we spend all our time wallowing in self-pity or blaming each other.<br /> 2. Writing off all supporters of the opposing candidate as stupid or morally bankrupt means we'll never connect to them, and we need to connect.&amp;quot; but you seem only interested in slamming liberal/left/Democratic elements of the election and the response to it. Make up your mind.<br /> <br /> You've already been reminded of the fact that Trumps stance on health care literally has lives in the balance. If you can't handle the idea that people might be highly emotional about the fact that Trump bungling &amp;quot;repeal and replace&amp;quot; means family and loved ones are going to <b>fucking die</b>, you might need to reevaluate your empathy meter on calling them hysterical.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> The protests aren't embarrassing. They're peaceful applications of the First Amendment. As well, they serve an incredibly important purpose: to remind Trump that very shortly it will be his job to do right by those protesters as the President of the whole country, not just his electorate. He needs to see how big of a climb he has in that regard. He needs to remember that it's his job to lead us back from this, not those that didn't vote for him's job to do what he says because he won. It's a reminder that the anger that got him elected has a counter-anger riled up and they aren't ready to forgive him if he fails to live up to his victory speech promises.</div> </div> </div> </div> Fair enough. Still skeptical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T13:15:14-08:00","id":1001455,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://t.co/QBU2fbJkJO\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://imagez.tmz.com/image/e4/16by9/2016/11/10/e43ae9dd092f5dbfbaa120e3160cf503_xl.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://t.co/QBU2fbJkJO\" target=\"_blank\"> Donald Trump -- Man Viciously Beaten, Car Stolen for Allegedly Voting Trump (VIDEO) </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://t.co/QBU2fbJkJO\" target=\"_blank\"> https://t.co/QBU2fbJkJO </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> A Chicago man was dragged out of his car and bashed in the head in broad daylight all because the attackers thought he voted for Donald Trump. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I don't know how true this is, but this is unfortunate, if true. I don't know how peaceful these protests are. I do know twitter is full of fuck white men, ignoring the fact that Romney got more of the white vote then Trump did and lost, it was Trumps increased women and minorities votes that pushed him over the top. But lets hate all white men while complaining about their racism and sexism, like Lacey Green. No self awareness at all.<br /> <br /> And people who are talking about suicide on the net, please don't do it, life is still worth living, I know your up set, I've been on the losing side, I know it hurts, but don't kill yourself, Trump isn't worth dying over.<br /> <br /> Get help if you need it, talk to a councillor or friend, family, ect...<br /> <br /> And those idiots who say they want to kill Trump or wish him dead, like Shoeonhead said, do you really want that jerk Vice President Pence as President?<br /> <br /> VP Pence makes Trump look like fucking Bernie Sanders by comparsion, so I suggest praying for Trump's health for the next four years.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T14:01:16-08:00","id":1001475,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001455#post1001455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://t.co/QBU2fbJkJO\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/QBU2fbJkJO</a><br /> VP Pence makes Trump look like fucking Bernie Sanders by comparsion, so I suggest praying for Trump's health for the next four years.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bNow there's a sentiment we both agree on. I'm pretty sure their appearances together will be extremely limited as well as few and far between. Pence absolutely is Trump's life insurance policy.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T14:07:17-08:00","id":1001481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001455#post1001455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And those idiots who say they want to kill Trump or wish him dead, like Shoeonhead said, do you really want that jerk Vice President Pence as President?<br /> <br /> VP Pence makes Trump look like fucking Bernie Sanders by comparsion, so I suggest praying for Trump's health for the next four years.</div> </div> </div> </div>I respect Kasich for turning down Trump's offer earlier to be his VP, but fuck me now I kind of wish he'd have taken it. Pence is a pretty scary guy.<br /> <br /> Still, Trump's ego is the one thing of his that I have absolute faith in. If Pence starts pushing for any weird ideas and people get mad at Trump, Trump will push back against Pence. Trump isn't the kind of person who will take heat for someone else, and he's already proven more than willing to toss Pence under the bus the moment Pence becomes a liability.<br /> <br /> Pence is going to have a fair amount of political power in Trump's new regime - I am reminded of Dick Cheney in W. Bush's presidency. At the same time though, Bush was willing to follow Cheney's advice and was willing to take heat for Cheney's actions and suggestions. I just don't think Trump's ego will let him be nearly as willing to do so for Pence. As a result, I think Trump will keep Pence from pushing any policies that are too divisive.<br /> <br /> But if Trump dies, we get Pence. And Pence is frighteningly anti-LGBT. I mean, he tried to reroute money in his state that was to be used to battle HIV and instead tried to have it used for gay conversion therapy going with his logic that, &quot;HIV is a gay disease, so making sure there are no more gays is a way of fighting HIV.&quot; He also pushed for and then happily signed a bill into law that would have had gay and lesbian couples arrested merely for <i>requesting</i> a marriage certificate.<br /> <br /> I think it would be very scary if Trump died and Pence was left in charge with a Republican Congress to try and get his whacky ideology set into law.<br /> <br /> While I'm not necessarily sure who the lesser evil was between Trump and Hillary, I'm pretty damn sure Trump is the lesser evil of Trump and Pence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 11-10-2016, 07:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T14:36:45-08:00","id":1001495,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001481#post1001481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I respect Kasich for turning down Trump's offer earlier to be his VP, but fuck me now I kind of wish he'd have taken it. Pence is a pretty scary guy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can fully understand why he did, though. Despite the fact that John Oliver did a ten-minute riff on the whole thing (which despite how terrifying it was, somehow <i>still</i> managed to be utterly hilarious), the scary thing about that was that the Trump campaign guy who called up Kasich's people apparently <i>actually did </i>offer him control over both domestic and foreign policy -- without any realization of how crazy a statement that was. And thinking the dude had simply misspoken, and trying to make sort a joke out of it, asked what that left for Trump to do, the immediate response (without <i>any</i> sense of irony at all) was &quot;Make America Great Again&quot;.<br /> <br /> \u200bIf I had been on the receiving end of that phone call, I'd have told him to f*** off too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T15:02:02-08:00","id":1001510,"title":"","content":"Kasich turned down the offer because it was simply &quot;you take the heat for anything that goes wrong while Trump takes the credit for things that go right&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T19:03:45-08:00","id":1001588,"title":"","content":"So pretty much the final vote tally in comparison to previous years (it's not quite done yet but the vast majority of votes are counted).<br /> <br /> <b>McCain</b> 59,948,323 million vs <b>Obama</b> 69,498,516 million<br /> <br /> <b>Romney</b> 60,933,504 million vs <b>Obama</b> 65,915,795 million<br /> <br /> <b>Trump</b> 59,535,522 million vs <b>H. Clinton</b> 59,755,284 million<br /> <br /> Interestingly, there wasn't a &quot;Trump Surge.&quot; In fact, he actually received fewer votes than either McCain or Romney did in 2008 and 2012 respectively. Hillary however received <i>ten million</i> fewer votes than Obama did back in 2008 and six million fewer votes than he did in 2012. It's honestly a little staggering how poorly she performed. Many Republicans didn't back Trump, but he managed to attract enough Independents and Democrats to more or less make up the difference. In contrast, quite a few Democrats didn't back Hillary and she didn't manage to attract swing voters in any real way with the result of being short millions and millions of votes.<br /> <br /> I think at the end of the day, this election was less an endorsement of Trump and more a rejection of Clinton.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T19:32:19-08:00","id":1001594,"title":"","content":"I've been in a state of horrified shock for two days now. But eventually I managed to pull myself out of my self-pity and start aggressively pursuing how I can pursue political action.<br /> <br /> This isn't an indictment of the gap-toothed hill folk and rich apocalyptic harbingers who voted for Trump. This is an indictment of all the people like me who were terrified of what Trump could do to our country and our world and didn't do enough to prevent it. I won't let that mistake happen again. Practically anyone who isn't a straight, white, cis-gendered male is in danger now. Clear and present physical danger. Maybe you voted for Trump, and maybe you weren't driven by bigotry or at the very least a callous indifference to the livelihoods of others, but if you don't do anything when the religious bans and racial violence arises, if you don't do anything when abortion rights are pushed back, rights for LGBQT people stripped away, and environmental policy gutted for the sake of a few greedy fuckers who would rather destroy our planet than die with a few dollars less... if those are things you aren't going to push back against, then I don't even know what to call you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8492,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","user":"dxanders","date":". 11-10-2016, 10:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T19:37:28-08:00","id":1001598,"title":"","content":"And now there's a Klan rally being organized in my state. They prefer the term, 'Victory Klavalkade Klan Parade.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":".  Forgot a k 11-10-2016, 10:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-10T20:30:47-08:00","id":1001608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001588#post1001588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think at the end of the day, this election was less an endorsement of Trump and more a rejection of Clinton.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm very much in agreement with this assessment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T00:22:54-08:00","id":1001654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManusDomine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001431#post1001431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> As an evil, soulless lawyer who hates freedom and only desires for money, few things annoy me more than when people think that burden of proof can be reinterpreted as they will it.<br /> <br /> As such, when I see someone do <i>that, </i>I simply feel compelled to point out that &quot;no u&quot; is in fact, not a valid argument when asked for proof.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really wish more patent lawyers shared your attitude...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T01:37:24-08:00","id":1001675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paradim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001654#post1001654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really wish more patent lawyers shared your attitude...</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh, not even lawyers like patent lawyers anyways.<br /> <br /> Speaking as a criminal lawyer of course, so I may be slightly biased.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T09:09:19-08:00","id":1001790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1000755#post1000755\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sure. My manse is infinitely large.<br /> <br /> We just need to make an oath we don't kill each other and become Deathlords.</div> </div> </div> </div>I...can't promise that!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But yeah, I haven't felt this upset by politics since High Queen Merela was forced to give up the Mandate of Heaven to the First Solar Deliberative...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Yeah. I'm hoping for a Bush scenario. Bush was all Jesus and the Second Coming and as soon as he was elected, he dropped it.<br /> <br /> I think the country is split down the middle. The issue we liberals have is we don't respect authority as the conservatives do. Getting us to vote for one individual is like herding cats. I remember during Obama's reelection, some of the younger liberals were voting third party because he supported some anti-piracy bill or something. </div> </div> </div>Well, it's been a couple of days, and as many have noted, Trump has been an ideal President-Elect so far. Which means he was either lying before on the campaign trail, or is lying now. I'm desperately hoping for the former, but am afraid it's the latter. The more I think about this, the more likely it seems that the running joke a lot of people have may actually be true: that this was essentially an elaborate publicity scheme that got out of control, Trump accidentally tapped into some national undercurrent that propelled him to an unexpected (even for him) victory, and now he's got to live with it and try to actually make this work. Maybe that's what he and Obama discussed for an hour and a half...<br /> <br /> The thing is that, even if he doesn't <i>really</i> believe all the horrible things he was saying, he galvanized a large segment of the population that <i>does</i>. It would be helpful for him to condemn this, but just as he could never admit to not running seriously (it would ruin him future business prospects), he also can't just come out and say to those who got him elected, &quot;Just kidding, I didn't really mean any of that&quot;, even though he really should, to assuage the panicking fears of those who believe their rights and lives are under threat from him and his followers.<br /> <br /> Probably his best course of action is to keep his head down, surround himself with professional people from all sides of the parties, let them do their things, try not to say/do anything TOO stupid, and just ride this thing out. Make a few token gestures to fulfill some campaign promises, but otherwise don't rock the boat. Of course, as Brexit showed, even token political gestures are dangerous, as there are people out there who will agree with ANY crazy idea, no matter how silly it seemed when you floated it out there just to make a point...<br /> <br /> Lastly, we shouldn't fall into the trap of demonizing Trump supporters, tho I'll admit to being guilty of this, too. Not ALL of them are acting from negative impulses, there really IS a large segment of the populace who has been ignored and who feel left behind. This is their world and their country, too, maybe we all should be listening more and trying to actually deal with their problems, so that they don't feel so desperate that they'll latch onto *anyone*, no matter how otherwise awful, who seems like he will help them...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":681,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","user":"Hand-of-Omega","date":". 11-11-2016, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T10:00:26-08:00","id":1001822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dxanders</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001594#post1001594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been in a state of horrified shock for two days now. But eventually I managed to pull myself out of my self-pity and start aggressively pursuing how I can pursue political action.<br /> <br /> This isn't an indictment of the gap-toothed hill folk and rich apocalyptic harbingers who voted for Trump. This is an indictment of all the people like me who were terrified of what Trump could do to our country and our world and didn't do enough to prevent it. I won't let that mistake happen again. Practically anyone who isn't a straight, white, cis-gendered male is in danger now. Clear and present physical danger. Maybe you voted for Trump, and maybe you weren't driven by bigotry or at the very least a callous indifference to the livelihoods of others, but if you don't do anything when the religious bans and racial violence arises, if you don't do anything when abortion rights are pushed back, rights for LGBQT people stripped away, and environmental policy gutted for the sake of a few greedy fuckers who would rather destroy our planet than die with a few dollars less... if those are things you aren't going to push back against, then I don't even know what to call you.</div> </div> </div> </div> No, if you wealthy it doesn't matter if your gay, black, white, trans, ect..., you'll be fine.<br /> <br /> Its the poor and the lower middle class that has to be concerned. Or Prime Minister Justin Trudeau, who now has to deal with this guy.<br /> <br /> I do have some concerns over who ends up on the Supreme Court.<br /> <br /> On the up side Canada will get to brain drain the shit out of a America, and hopefully Nafta and the TPP dies. What both countries need is a new autopact, you know the trade agreement that ACTUALLLY CREATED MANUFACTURING JOBS, instead of destroying them or sending over seas.<br /> <br /> Still I worry for Americans poor of all races, if your rich you'll make out like a bandit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T10:11:19-08:00","id":1001831,"title":"","content":"I'll also point out that excessive PC stuff helped Trump to win, don't kill the messanger, experts have pointed this out, just my advice, toned down the PC stuff, don't worry about microaggressions and correct gender pronouns, when the fucking wolf is at the door.<br /> <br /> And stop villifying cis white males, no likes being demonized, it just drives people to Trump.<br /> <br /> And no more of this free speech zones, America, no, North America IS a Free Speech zone.<br /> <br /> Someone I know, internet handle Pondering, and who I often disagree with, but not this time said this.<br /> <br /> &quot;The left calls unemployed white blue-collar workers privileged sending them into the arms of the Trumps of the world then blames the right.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 11-11-2016, 01:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T10:51:32-08:00","id":1001841,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001831#post1001831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">don't worry about correct gender pronouns</div> </div> </div> </div>Fuck that. I deserve respect and so do my trans loved ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T11:50:48-08:00","id":1001865,"title":"","content":"So much for not blaming people and writing off supporters of candidates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T12:24:38-08:00","id":1001874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001841#post1001841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fuck that. I deserve respect and so do my trans loved ones.</div> </div> </div> </div> Respect yes, on the other hand 50 different trans pronouns, mostly put together by people aren't actually trans, and people who are riding your tail trying to exploit your stuff to feel special, no. Pick 1 and stick with it.<br /> <br /> Pick one set of pronouns, not a legion, no one is going to remember them. And not they as a singular, because that can get confusing. 1 pronoun, keep it simple for the rest of us, and it wouldn't be a big deal for people, but new pronouns are appearing every day. I can barely remember peoples names!<br /> <br /> I'm not unreasonable, but it has to be a two way street.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 11-11-2016, 03:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T12:33:34-08:00","id":1001879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001874#post1001874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pick one set of pronouns, not a legion, no one is going to remember them. And not they as a singular, because that can get confusing. 1 pronoun, keep it simple for the rest of us, and it wouldn't be a big deal for people, but new pronouns are appearing every day. I can barely remember peoples names!</div> </div> </div> </div>You're asking that an entire spectrum of sexual identity be summed up with one pronoun, for the sake of bare simplicity at the cost of people's basic identity. That's... I'll be nice and say silly and rude.*<br /> <br /> *or fuck you. Whichever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T13:09:47-08:00","id":1001897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001874#post1001874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Respect yes, on the other hand 50 different trans pronouns, mostly put together by people aren't actually trans, and people who are riding your tail trying to exploit your stuff to feel special, no. Pick 1 and stick with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Refusing to call someone what they ask to be called is not respectful. Period. I don't care if they're trans or not, if a person asks you to refer to them a certain way, it's disrespectful to deny them that courtesy. And by what fucking metric do you decide who is or isn't &quot;actually trans&quot;? Who gave you the right to determine who's genders are valid and who's aren't?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001874#post1001874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pick one set of pronouns, not a legion, no one is going to remember them. And not they as a singular, because that can get confusing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bullshit. It is trivially easy to use context cues to determine whether the word &quot;you&quot; is being used in the singular or plural form, and the same is true of &quot;they&quot;. If you don't like it, tough shit, it's grammatically correct English so get used to it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001874#post1001874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1 pronoun, keep it simple for the rest of us, and it wouldn't be a big deal for people, but new pronouns are appearing every day. I can barely remember peoples names!</div> </div> </div> </div>And what do you do when you forget someone's name? You apologize and ask them to remind you. You can do the same thing with pronouns.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001874#post1001874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not unreasonable, but it has to be a two way street.</div> </div> </div> </div> No, you are unreasonable. You are literally telling people that your convenience is more important than their identities. That is unreasonable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T13:18:09-08:00","id":1001904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001874#post1001874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Respect yes, on the other hand 50 different trans pronouns, mostly put together by people aren't actually trans, and people who are riding your tail trying to exploit your stuff to feel special, no. Pick 1 and stick with it.<br /> <br /> Pick one set of pronouns, not a legion, no one is going to remember them. And not they as a singular, because that can get confusing. 1 pronoun, keep it simple for the rest of us, and it wouldn't be a big deal for people, but new pronouns are appearing every day. I can barely remember peoples names!<br /> <br /> I'm not unreasonable, but it has to be a two way street.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not up to you to decide who is and isn't trans. And he, she, and they are the vast majority of pronouns in use anyway. But more importantly, why is a modicum of effort on your end worth more than someone's identity?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T13:30:57-08:00","id":1001912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001831#post1001831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll also point out that excessive PC stuff helped Trump to win, don't kill the messanger, experts have pointed this out, just my advice, toned down the PC stuff, don't worry about microaggressions and correct gender pronouns, when the fucking wolf is at the door.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be doubtful of these 'experts.' The turnout wasn't great and that tends to favor Republicans, and there was a lot more going against Clinton than any problem you have with pronouns.<br /> <br /> In addition it wouldn't explain why Oregon's just elected our first openly LGBT governor on a platform that includes accepting preferred names and pronouns on official education material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T13:44:30-08:00","id":1001916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManusDomine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001675#post1001675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Heh, not even lawyers like patent lawyers anyways.<br /> <br /> Speaking as a criminal lawyer of course, so I may be slightly biased.</div> </div> </div> </div>Understandably so. ^.^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T13:52:41-08:00","id":1001918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001790#post1001790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I...can't promise that!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> </div> </div> </div> </div>GET OUT OF MY MANSE!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001790#post1001790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But yeah, I haven't felt this upset by politics since High Queen Merela was forced to give up the Mandate of Heaven to the First Solar Deliberative...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>This ranks a bit above that, but below that time Kejak and friends killed all the Sidereals who disagreed with them. And then killed all the Solars and locked their shards away forever.<br /> <br /> Because violence against people you disagree with is never going to happen again, right?<br /> <br /> Right?<br /> <br /> /It started out as a joke and then just got sad.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T13:56:11-08:00","id":1001920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001790#post1001790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably his best course of action is to keep his head down, surround himself with professional people from all sides of the parties, let them do their things, try not to say/do anything TOO stupid, and just ride this thing out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately... he's already screwed that up. He's got his phone and Twitter back, and has already opted to &quot;unify&quot; the country by using the &quot;professional protester&quot; nonsense to dismiss the current protests going on.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001822#post1001822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, if you wealthy it doesn't matter if your gay, black, white, trans, ect..., you'll be fine.</div> </div> </div> </div>To paraphrase my late grandfather: the worst thing about not being able to tell my uncle &quot;I told you so,&quot; is that the Nazis were the ones that had to prove me right.<br /> <br /> Around 1/5 members of my maternal family made it out of Germany, and they were definitely wealthy back then. None of the 4/5s that didn't get out in time survived.<br /> <br /> I don't think Trump is going to actually make things that bad. Even in my worst fears for his administration. But I cannot accept this way of thinking, because I have a list of family members I never got to meet that thought they'd be fine. &quot;I fought for Germany in the Great War, I have medals for my dedication to my country!&quot; Yeah, that didn't mean shit when the SS finally came. &quot;I'm wealthy, I can afford to move if things get worse!&quot; Nope, the SS just took all the money away and threw them in camps. &quot;We're well respected, we own a factory and treat our employees well. We're praised as hard working and generous members of the community. Our Christian neighbors wouldn't turn on us when were' like family!&quot; You know where this went.<br /> <br /> Wealth, power, privilege, these are ephemeral things. They can disappear in an instant. They only protect you as long as the society around you lets them protect you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001831#post1001831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll also point out that excessive PC stuff helped Trump to win, don't kill the messanger, experts have pointed this out, just my advice, toned down the PC stuff, don't worry about microaggressions and correct gender pronouns, when the fucking wolf is at the door.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm tired of this crap. From the right, center, and left, the whole, narrative of Trump being the Left's fault is inane. We didn't let him into our political party power structures. We didn't nominate him for an office. We didn't elect him. We don't want him, and never did.<br /> <br /> Sure, we could have done more to stop him, but we should have never had to. The intellectual conservatives chickened out of keeping their political party sane. They fomented distrust of anything that isn't what you want to hear, and then got ignored when they said things their based didn't want to hear.<br /> <br /> Telling people to stop &quot;being PC,&quot; is nothing more than admitting that people don't really care about &quot;telling it like it is,&quot; they only care about hearing what they want to hear; damn anything but their feelings.<br /> <br /> Yes, most of Trumps supporters are generally decent people that let their anger get the better of them. But that's not justification. That's not an excuse. That's not something you get to hang on the neck of the other side. They bare the moral weight of that decision.<br /> <br /> It's just like Ryan and Mcconell whining when they override Obama's veto and then realized they passed a piece of shit law. They blamed Obama for not doing enough to stop them.<br /> <br /> No. That's not how this shit should work. You'd never accept that from other people in your daily life. &quot;I know I was supposed to do the dishes, but it's your fault for not yelling at me to do them more than the two time you already did.&quot; is not an argument a kid would get away with. If someone rear ended you because you cut them off, you're not going to say, &quot;Dude, you should totally sue me, because your road rage negates any responsibility for your actions, and I shouldn't sue you for wrecking my car in return.&quot; You're going to say, &quot;Getting cut off isn't a reason to wreck my car, I hope your insurance is good.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","ti