\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T15:12:44-08:00","id":1001945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001942#post1001942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cis white males are why I'm going to lose my healthcare and why several of my friends and mother's coworkers are terrified their going to get deported or harassed and assaulted.<br /> <br /> I'll villify them as much as I goddamned well please.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cis white males were also the reason some countries got it. Where (if anywhere) my dick likes to hang out has nothing to do with politics, no more or less than does the size of my (or anyone's) cranium.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T15:12:54-08:00","id":1001946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001874#post1001874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Respect yes, on the other hand 50 different trans pronouns, mostly put together by people aren't actually trans, and people who are riding your tail trying to exploit your stuff to feel special, no. Pick 1 and stick with it.<br /> <br /> Pick one set of pronouns, not a legion, no one is going to remember them. And not they as a singular, because that can get confusing. 1 pronoun, keep it simple for the rest of us, and it wouldn't be a big deal for people, but new pronouns are appearing every day. I can barely remember peoples names!<br /> <br /> I'm not unreasonable, but it has to be a two way street.</div> </div> </div> </div>But this is unreasonable - you're telling people to shove their identities into the closet under vague claims that it will somehow make things better or just stop being an inconvenience to people who don't give a shit anyway.<br /> <br /> Also, there is literally nothing wrong with singular they.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T15:15:33-08:00","id":1001947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001942#post1001942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cis white males are why I'm going to lose my healthcare and why several of my friends and mother's coworkers are terrified their going to get deported or harassed and assaulted.<br /> <br /> I'll vilify them as much as I goddamned well please.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will that help anything?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T15:48:19-08:00","id":1001962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001942#post1001942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cis white males are why I'm going to lose my healthcare and why several of my friends and mother's coworkers are terrified their going to get deported or harassed and assaulted.<br /> <br /> I'll vilify them as much as I goddamned well please.</div> </div> </div> </div>You might also want to vilify African-Americans, and women, and Hispanics and... well, I mean, lots of people voted for Trump after all. If the only people who had voted for Trump were cis white males, he obviously would not have been elected. Further, lots of people of all races, creeds and genders stayed home rather than vote for either - maybe you should vilify all of those people for Trump's election while you're at it.<br /> <br /> Of course, there were quite a few cis white males (like me) who voted for Hillary. You wanna vilify me too because of what I am, knock yourself out though.<br /> <br /> But that just reinforces the point Omega was making - all that's going to happen if cis white males are vilified, is that in two years (and in four years) the left will watch in shock, surprise and outrage as cis white males break for the candidates and the party who don't demonize them and help put those people in charge of the country.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T15:54:07-08:00","id":1001963,"title":"","content":"&quot;Not all cis/het/white/etc. people&quot; misses the point in exactly the same way #notallmen does. Yes, we understand that individuals are individual. But we really don't need to be focusing attention on pointing out the obvious fact that having privelage doesn't automatically make you a bad person when we could be spending that energy focusing on the systemic imbalance of power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T16:24:23-08:00","id":1001970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001963#post1001963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Not all cis/het/white/etc. people&quot; misses the point in exactly the same way #notallmen does. Yes, we understand that individuals are individual. But we really don't need to be focusing attention on pointing out the obvious fact that having privelage doesn't automatically make you a bad person when we could be spending that energy focusing on the systemic imbalance of power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Specifically noting that you are going out of your way to vilify an entire demographic based on the way they were born is always wrong and unfair, regardless of whether you are vilifying Hispanics, African-Americans, Muslims Jews, women or - yes, even cis white males.<br /> <br /> *EDIT*<br /> <br /> I mean, if someone said something like:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> African-American males are why I'm going to lose my &lt;BLANK&gt; and why several of my friends and mother's coworkers are terrified they're going to get &lt;BLANKED&gt; or harassed and assaulted.<br /> <br /> I'll vilify them as much as I goddamned well please. </div> </div> </div>I would hope that people call them out and say, &quot;Whoa now, let's not go making broad generalizations against a group like that. That's just not cool.&quot;<br /> <br /> And hopefully nobody would be responding, &quot;#notallAfrican-Americans misses the point. We understand individuals are individuals. We don't need to focus on the obvious fact that not all African-American males are bad people.&quot;<br /> <br /> Demonizing based on racial, gender or sexual demographics is just not cool, no matter who you're doing it to. All that does is make the innocent members of the group you're vilifying dislike you and not want to work with you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 11-11-2016, 07:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":15}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T16:35:43-08:00","id":1001975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001963#post1001963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Not all cis/het/white/etc. people&quot; misses the point in exactly the same way #notallmen does. Yes, we understand that individuals are individual. But we really don't need to be focusing attention on pointing out the obvious fact that having privelage doesn't automatically make you a bad person when we could be spending that energy focusing on the systemic imbalance of power.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, asking people from the &quot;privileged&quot; group work together against bigots, while at the same time being asked to take being lumped together as a group (which tend to be considered bigoted to quite a few), is a tad counter-productive.<br /> <br /> I live on the other side of that pond we call the Atlantic, so it won't affect me much if all of you keep dividing yourself. But if you are serious of wanting people to focus their energy on systematic imbalance of power, you are making that mistake. Not all &quot;#notallmen&quot; are bullshit, even if some are. If everyone tries to use a bit more nuanced language, my guess there would be less &quot;missed points&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T16:52:05-08:00","id":1001981,"title":"","content":"So demonizing cis white men who didn't support this is perfectly within the forums ToS? pls redtext yourself. This is a group attack and I can't report or flag a mod post because that is against the ToS. You are insulated from any real form of criticism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T17:17:17-08:00","id":1001994,"title":"","content":"Really your idenity can be summed up in a couple of pronouns that most people won't understand anyways.<br /> <br /> And I don't decide what is or isn't trans, science does, this hardwired into the brain, trans M2F Blair White did a video on it explaining it. Look I don't want to get into an arguement over it, it was just a piece of friendly advise, take it or leave it.<br /> <br /> And before anyone accuses me or transphobia, I support publicly funded sex changes, trans anti discrimination laws here in Canada, but I also support freedom of speech, and a lot of people like that Toronto Professor aren't going to use your pronouns anyways, even if you fire him, as will most people I know, who don't care if your trans, bit will ignore your pronouns.<br /> <br /> For the record I have no problem using anyways pronouns, although I have brain damage so you maybe to remind me often.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 11-11-2016, 08:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T17:23:40-08:00","id":1001996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001970#post1001970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Specifically noting that you are going out of your way to vilify an entire demographic based on the way they were born is always wrong and unfair, regardless of whether you are vilifying Hispanics, African-Americans, Muslims Jews, women or - yes, even cis white males.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry, did I do that?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001970#post1001970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*EDIT*<br /> <br /> I mean, if someone said something like:<br /> <br /> I would hope that people call them out and say, &quot;Whoa now, let's not go making broad generalizations against a group like that. That's just not cool.&quot;<br /> <br /> And hopefully nobody would be responding, &quot;#notallAfrican-Americans misses the point. We understand individuals are individuals. We don't need to focus on the obvious fact that not all African-American males are bad people.&quot;<br /> <br /> Demonizing based on racial, gender or sexual demographics is just not cool, no matter who you're doing it to. All that does is make the innocent members of the group you're vilifying dislike you and not want to work with you.</div> </div> </div> </div>The difference is that unlike African American men, white men in America are not the victims of systematic injustice. Revenge's post could hurt people'a feelings, which, sure is not a great thing. Your hypothetical riff on it would contribute to a broader culture of oppression against African American men, which is a problem on a different level. That's why I say &quot;not all white dudes&quot; misses the point, because your counter-example post isn't problematic because it's a generalization, it's problematic because it contributes to a broader system of injustice.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lundgren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001975#post1001975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, asking people from the &quot;privileged&quot; group work together against bigots, while at the same time being asked to take being lumped together as a group (which tend to be considered bigoted to quite a few), is a tad counter-productive.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not what I'm suggesting?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lundgren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001975#post1001975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I live on the other side of that pond we call the Atlantic, so it won't affect me much if all of you keep dividing yourself. But if you are serious of wanting people to focus their energy on systematic imbalance of power, you are making that mistake. Not all &quot;#notallmen&quot; are bullshit, even if some are.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, individual #notallmen posts are not the issue. We need to focus on systems, not on individuals.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lundgren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001975#post1001975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If everyone tries to use a bit more nuanced language, my guess there would be less &quot;missed points&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do endeavor to use nuanced language.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001981#post1001981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So demonizing cis white men who didn't support this is perfectly within the forums ToS?</div> </div> </div> </div>I never said that. If you think a post violates the TOS, flag it and the mods will evaluate it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001981#post1001981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">pls redtext yourself. This is a group attack and I can't report or flag a mod post because that is against the ToS. You are insulated from any real form of criticism.</div> </div> </div> </div>Its not against the TOS to flag a mod. In fact, the rules specifically say moderators and Onyx Path staff are not above the forum rules. If you believe my post was in violation of the rules, by all means please flag it. Another mod will evaluate it and issue an infraction if it is found to be a rule violation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T17:39:20-08:00","id":1002004,"title":"","content":"&gt;another mod will evaluate it<br /> it still won't be unbiased. I'll no longer be a cis white male. I am not a transracial pansexual demiboy kaijukin. Now I can actually have an opinion. This whole &quot;you must be this marginalized to have an opinion&quot; shit is what got people in this mess. By completely destroying the ability for a dialogue to be opened the divide was furthered. &quot;Those stupid cis white male country bumpkins are fucking their cousins and smoking meth&quot; congrats, you just alienated people further.<br /> <br /> If you are going to hold all cis white men responsible for what happened then when the civil war starts because people want the electoral college to go completely against what we have in place I will blame you as well. You might not have endorsed it or signed the petition but you stand with these people. I don't stand with the &lt;BLANK&gt;ist but because I just happen to be a while straight male I'm evil. Think about your wording.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T17:48:53-08:00","id":1002006,"title":"","content":"You're confusing who said what. Charlaquin didn't say she'd villify anyone.<br /> <br /> You can claim that the election was won because one side didn't want to use proper pronouns, but that wasn't part of Clinton's platform and it didn't decide the election. Wherever this conversation belongs, it's not in this thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 11-11-2016, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T17:53:42-08:00","id":1002009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1001996#post1001996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The difference is that unlike African American men, white men in America are not the victims of systematic injustice. Revenge's post could hurt people'a feelings, which, sure is not a great thing. Your hypothetical riff on it would contribute to a broader culture of oppression against African American men, which is a problem on a different level. That's why I say &quot;not all white dudes&quot; misses the point, because your counter-example post isn't problematic because it's a generalization, it's problematic because it contributes to a broader system of injustice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, I was pointing out that Revenge's comment, where he decided to lump all straight, white males together and then vilify them because of how they were born was problematic for many reasons.<br /> <br /> And your response was to get into how #notallmales misses the point, and that it's fine to vilify a broad group of people, provided that group has not faced &quot;oppression&quot; at the hands of society in the past.<br /> <br /> Which, again, I flatly disagree with.<br /> <br /> It's wrong to vilify any group based around race, sex, gender or creed. It ignores the fact that there are vast differences even among cis males. To treat them all like a single group, and to vilify all of them because of the actions of some, at the core, no different from treating <i>any</i> racial group like a single entity and vilifying all members of that group because of the actions of some of them.<br /> <br /> It's wrong and unfair to do it to anyone. And specifically, it's wrong to treat <i>me</i> like I am less of a person and deserve to be vilified because some other cis white males happen to be dicks. Fuck that noise. I'm not those people. I'm not responsible for their actions. I don't deserve to be vilified for the actions that other people who happened to be born with a few traits they share in common with me decided to do.<br /> <br /> And finally, to suggest that it's okay to lump me in with all of the other cis males and vilify me because taking a moment to note that not all cis males deserve to be vilified would be a, &quot;waste of energy&quot; that could instead be spent on focusing on the systemic imbalance of power is just damn insulting. I'm happy to use the different pronouns and such that trans people request be used. I'm happy to include LGBTQ and other members of communities in my life's choices. I'm happy to support them and speak up for them. I have spent time and money advocating for the rights and of physically and mentally handicapped people.<br /> <br /> I have used a fair amount of energy to help other people. But then to have it suggested that it would be a waste of energy to casually note that maybe not all cis white males deserve to be vilified just leaves me shaking my head. This idea, that cis white males are expected to bend over for every other group they can, but then smile when they get kicked in the teeth is the kind of thing that drives cis white males into Trump's arms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 11-11-2016, 09:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:01:19-08:00","id":1002018,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002006#post1002006\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're confusing who said what. Charlaquin didn't say she'd villify anyone.<br /> <br /> You can claim that the election was won because one side didn't want to use proper pronouns, but that wasn't part of Clinton's platform and it didn't decide the election. Wherever this conversation belongs, it's not in this thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are missing the point. She endorses this point of view. At the same time she has also endorsed that you are either part of the white male &quot;problem&quot; or not. This is simple bigotry. If I can't call that out and show how hypocritical it is then congrats, you have completely shut down all discourse and discussion. Not all Muslims was held to be true and I believe it to be true but we can't have the same mentality for white men. Pls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:14:28-08:00","id":1002024,"title":"","content":"I'm a sexual dominate, that's my sexual orinientation, but I don't expect people to call me Dom, Master, or acknowledge it in normal conversation, because 99% of the time its not relevant. And because asking people to do that would freak most of them out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:16:07-08:00","id":1002025,"title":"","content":"I don't like speaking for people, if you have a problem flag them.<br /> <br /> That said.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002018#post1002018\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are missing the point. She endorses this point of view. At the same time she has also endorsed that you are either part of the white male &quot;problem&quot; or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>Where? As far as I see she's said that blaming individuals or groups isn't the problem. The structure that causes all this is.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This is simple bigotry. If I can't call that out and show how hypocritical it is then congrats, you have completely shut down all discourse and discussion. </div> </div> </div>You're the only one who said you couldn't call it out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Not all Muslims was held to be true and I believe it to be true but we can't have the same mentality for white men. Pls. </div> </div> </div>'Not all anyone' doesn't need to be stated. It's understood from the start. But when it's used it's used to just derail things, like how the last dozen posts which have careened from talking about the fucking election results and how peoples health care can be taken away to this. You can't have a discussion about the problems with injustice if you have to answer every, 'Well I'm a 'something' and I never did this or that.'<br /> <br /> Basically, can you agree that there is a system in place that favors traditional belief systems over progressive ones? That favors the majority of a region? And that, in America, that majority is white? And that the people in power have a strong tendency to be white and male, and that these white males traditionally favor other white males over non-white non-males?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002024#post1002024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a sexual dominate, that's my sexual orinientation, but I don't expect people to call me Dom, Master, or acknowledge it in normal conversation, because 99% of the time its not relevant.</div> </div> </div> </div>What if it wasn't irrelevant? What if there was a bathroom only sexual dominates were allowed to go in, or risk getting arrested? What if it mattered when you went to the doctor, or a psychiatrist? What if, legally, sexually dominates were only allowed to marry a sexually submissive and you had to prove what you were first? What if the police pull you over and ask why you look like a dominate if your driver's license says you're a submissive? Gender and sexuality isn't something that only matters behind closed doors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 11-11-2016, 09:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:35:27-08:00","id":1002032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002004#post1002004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&gt;another mod will evaluate it<br /> it still won't be unbiased.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry you feel that way, I guess? I wouldn't hesitate to infract a fellow mod if I felt they were violating the rules, and I trust the others would do the same for me. I'm not going to infract my own post though, because I don't think it was against the rules (I wouldn't have posted it if I did).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002004#post1002004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll no longer be a cis white male. I am not a transracial pansexual demiboy kaijukin. Now I can actually have an opinion. This whole &amp;quot;you must be this marginalized to have an opinion&amp;quot; shit is what got people in this mess. By completely destroying the ability for a dialogue to be opened the divide was furthered</div> </div> </div> </div>Got enough straw there? That argument your constructing seems a little flat.<br /> <br /> I have never once said, and never will say, that people in positions of privelage don't have a right to an opinion, because I don't believe it is true. I don't think I have ever seen or heard anyone say it who wasn't made of straw.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002004#post1002004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> &amp;quot;Those stupid cis white male country bumpkins are fucking their cousins and smoking meth&amp;quot; congrats, you just alienated people further.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wha...??? Not only is this not something I have asserted and don't agree with in any way, it's also a complete non-sequitur that bears absolutely no resemblance to anything I have said. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002004#post1002004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> If you are going to hold all cis white men responsible for what happened then when the civil war starts because people want the electoral college to go completely against what we have in place I will blame you as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good thing I have no intention of holding all cis white men responsible for anything,I guess...? And no, I don't want the electoral college to go away (I think that's what you meant?)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002004#post1002004\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You might not have endorsed it or signed the petition but you stand with these people. I don't stand with the &lt;BLANK&gt;ist but because I just happen to be a while straight male I'm evil. Think about your wording.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have thought about my wording; I don't think that being straight, white, and/or male automatically makes someone a bad person, and I specifically said so in my post. I think the fact that being straight, white, and or male doesn't automatically make someone a bad person is so painfully obvious that it should go without saying, which is why I made my comment in the first place. Maybe you should read my wording more carefully.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:37:40-08:00","id":1002034,"title":"","content":"Lets see if we can get back on topic and have a civil discussion. Since it's in the new a lot now what do people think of the Electoral College, should we keep it or not?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9486-jbrocky","name":"JBRocky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9486_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:50:01-08:00","id":1002035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JBRocky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002034#post1002034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lets see if we can get back on topic and have a civil discussion. Since it's in the new a lot now what do people think of the Electoral College, should we keep it or not?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it was important when it was made, no one could really foresee how the population would grow and where, and it stood to reason cities would vastly outnumber the country. But I'd be for letting go of it.<br /> <br /> The problem is it's a double edged sword. 'My side' won't always win the popular vote. But people seem to think it's fairer, so why not.<br /> <br /> Honestly, I like the original idea where the one who gets the most votes is president, the second-most becomes vice president. Though I see some of the obvious problems with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:54:00-08:00","id":1002038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JBRocky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1002034#post1002034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lets see if we can get back on topic and have a civil discussion. Since it's in the new a lot now what do people think of the Electoral College, should we keep it or not?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've given it some thought ever since the 2000 election. Honestly I don't have an issue with the electoral college. It allows smaller, less populated states to still have a significant amount of influence over the election of the president. Without the electoral college, less populated states would be completely meaningless. Yes, that does mean that electing the president in the US is more complicated than simply convincing a slight majority of voters to vote for you, but I don't see that as a bad thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-11T18:57:10-08:00","id":1002039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin