w\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://swingleft.org/\" target=\"_blank\"> Swing Left &mdash; Help Democrats win </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://swingleft.org/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://swingleft.org/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Join Swing Left to help flip the House and support Democratic victories through grassroots efforts and innovative voter engagement programs. </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"https://www.sisterdistrict.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.sisterdistrict.com/</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh, I absolutely intend to vote in the 2018 midterms and I voted for Hillary back in 2016. When I say &quot;we&quot;, I mean the American electorate as a whole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T11:41:58-07:00","id":1077098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1076964#post1076964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd actually never heard the phrase &quot;Polish Death Camp&quot; before reading your post. I don't think (most of) the USA &quot;insists&quot; on anything - it's just a mistake.<br /> <br /> Also, I found something amusing while reading the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%22Polish_death_camp%22_controversy\" target=\"_blank\">wikipedia article</a> on this topic - in 2012, then-president Barack Obama took flack for using the phrase while awarding a posthumous Medal of Freedom to Jan Karski, legendary Polish resistance fighter. Jan Karski himself apparently coined the term in an article he wrote in 1944.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm Canadian and I can say this is the first time I can recall hearing the phrase as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T15:20:03-07:00","id":1077268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WHW</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1076918#post1076918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This seem to have turned into &quot;general USA politics thread&quot;, so this is as good place as any to post it:<br /> Why the hell USA insists on calling nazi concetration camps that were placed in Poland &quot;Polish Concentration Camps&quot; and &quot;Polish Death Camps? This is an issue for like forever, our embassy in US alarms that just tihs year they had to intervene 30ty times due to this term. In the past, even your high officials like Barack Obama or FBI Director James Comey do it, so it's not just uneducated masses or ignorant press...</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately it's an old school term that was popular back during the 50's and 60's in America (and other Western nations). Specifically the term was pushed by West German intelligence agents as a propaganda trick in order to distance West Germany from the Holocaust. Since Poland was part of the USSR at the time, and since the Nazi death camps were in Poland, it became the perfect scapegoat. If most of the camps had been located in Estonia, they would have been calling them, &quot;Estonian Death Camps.&quot;<br /> <br /> Now, it's safe to say that most everybody in the US (besides those who deny the Holocaust ever happened) know that the Nazis were German and the death camps weren't run by Poles. I don't think there's a whole lot of doubt about that. But unfortunately many of America's current leaders grew up hearing the term during their formative years in the Cold War, they're still using it today, and many of them honestly believe that's the proper term since that's what they heard growing up and have been saying their whole lives. That West German propaganda was pretty effective, huh?<br /> <br /> For what it's worth though, you almost never hear the term from Gen X'ers or Millennials. Most history books and programs where they learned about World War 2 stick to the term, &quot;Nazi Death Camp&quot; or &quot;Nazi Concentration Camp&quot; so that's what most younger people use.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 04-12-2017, 08:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T15:30:26-07:00","id":1077277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>semicasual</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-election-result-thread?p=1076964#post1076964\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd actually never heard the phrase &quot;Polish Death Camp&quot; before reading your post. I don't think (most of) the USA &quot;insists&quot; on anything - it's just a mistake.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm only one data point, but I'm an American with a history degree and I cannot recall ever hearing &quot;Polish Death Camp&quot; used in any context.<br /> <br /> Are they anything like &quot;Holocaust Centers&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T17:27:43-07:00","id":1077349,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1000616-2016-electio